\par 1. \cf0  Jesus, my Saviour, to Bethlehem came,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Born in a manger to sorrow and shame;
\par Oh, it was wonderful-blest be His name!
\par Seeking for me, for me!\i 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \i0 Seeking for me! Seeking for me!
\par Seeking for me! Seeking for me!
\par Oh, it was wonderful-blest he His name!
\par Seeking  for me, for me!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Jesus, my Saviour, on Calvary's tree,
\par      Paid the great debt, and my soul!
\par      He set free; -
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Oh, it was wonderful-how could it be?
\par Dying for me, for me!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \i0 Dying for me! Dying for me!
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Dying for me! Dying for me!
\par Oh, it was wonderful-how could it be?
\par Dying for me, for me!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. Jesus my Saviour, the same as of old.
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 While I was wand'ring afar from the fold,
\par Gently and long did He plead with my soul,
\par Calling for me, for me!
\par \b\i 
\par \cf1\ul\i0\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \i0 Calling for me! Calling for me!
\par Calling for me! Calling for me!
\par Gently  and long did He plead with my soul,
\par Calling for me, for me!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Jesus my Saviour shall come from on
\par     high-sweet is the promise as weary years fly;
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Oh, I shall see Him descend from the sky,
\par  Coming for me, for me!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 Coming for me! Coming for me !
\par Coming for me! Coming for me!
\par Oh, I shall see him descend from the sky,
\par Coming for me, for me!
